    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various modules</h2>Structure : Wall, Ground, Ramp, Ice, Glass, etc.<br>Free Fall : Stone ball, Basketball, Dice, Grenade, Compound cube, etc.<br>Machines : Car, Single Wheel, Claw, Conveyor, Door, Ejector, Elevator, etc.<br>Gravity : Modules that could change the direction/size of gravity.<br>Button :  Some physics interactive buttons.<br>Keyboard/Mouse : Uses keyboard or mouse to click the buttons.<br>Calculate : Constant, Equal, Counter, Digit display, etc.<br>Others : Music note, Bomb, Accelerator, LED, Win trigger, etc.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzle mode</h2>Use specific modules to build, try to press the specific button to pass the level.<br>40 levels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Free mode</h2>Use all modules, unlimited, build scene you like.<br>Save / Load the scene you build.<br>Export the scene you build to a file, you could share it to your friend or others.",
